<title>FINLAND: FISKARS H1 PROFIT UP TO FIM 139 MLN.</title>
<headline>FISKARS H1 PROFIT UP TO FIM 139 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinaries	    139 vs 122</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	    11.40 vs 10.90</p>
<p> Net sales				    1,096 vs 1,206</p>
<p> Operating profit (of existing ops.)   120 vs 116</p>
<p> Gross margin				  399 vs 435</p>
<p> Net financial items		 charge 20 vs 36 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items		  gain 650 vs nil</p>
<p> Profit before taxes			 789 vs 122</p>
<p> Net profit				    564 vs 82</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	 55 vs 39</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts mean forecast was for a 110 million markka</p>
<p>first-half profit before extraordinaries.</p>
<p>Full name of Finnish consumer goods maker is Fiskars Oy</p>
<p>Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
